  - the entries carrying format specifiers, because upstream's catalog keys use
    `%@`/`%lld` and Android needs `%1$s`/`%1$d` — their Chinese is upstream's,
    with the placeholders re-indexed;
  - the sentences this port merged out of a Kotlin `+`, which have no single
    upstream key to match;
